    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "It's a colour secret! In summer, leaves are full of green stuff called chlorophyll.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🍃",
        "text": "Green chlorophyll",
        "cue": "green",
        "sub": "Say: KLOR-oh-fill",
        "sub_cue": "chlorophyll"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "What does chlorophyll do?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "It helps the leaf turn sunlight into food for the tree.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "☀️",
        "text": "Sunlight into food",
        "cue": "sunlight",
        "sub": "Food for the tree",
        "sub_cue": "food"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "So why do leaves turn orange?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "In autumn, the days get shorter and cooler. The tree stops making chlorophyll, and the green slowly fades away.",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "In autumn",
        "items": [
          {
            "icon": "🌙",
            "label": "Shorter days",
            "cue": "shorter"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🌡️",
            "label": "Cooler weather",
            "cue": "cooler"
          },
          {
            "icon": "🍃",
            "label": "The green fades",
            "cue": "fades"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "And here's the secret. Yellow and orange were hiding in the leaf all summer long. Now we can finally see them!",
      "punch": "hiding",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🍂",
        "text": "Hidden yellow and orange",
        "cue": "hiding",
        "sub": "There all summer!",
        "sub_cue": "summer"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "What about the red leaves?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Some trees make brand new red and purple colours in autumn. That's why maple trees can look so bright.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🍁",
        "text": "Red is made new!",
        "cue": "red",
        "sub": "In trees like maples",
        "sub_cue": "maple"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Then why do the leaves fall off?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "The tree lets them go, and rests all winter. Then in spring, brand new green leaves grow!",
      "board": {
